100
00:04:14.610 --> 00:04:15.876
Take a look.

101
00:04:15.876 --> 00:04:18.459
(upbeat music)

102
00:04:21.140 --> 00:04:23.110
Hey, Drew, I am so excited

103
00:04:23.110 --> 00:04:25.830
to create a beautiful living room for Denise.

104
00:04:25.830 --> 00:04:26.700
But here's the thing,

105
00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:29.030
I definitely want it to be functional

106
00:04:29.030 --> 00:04:30.860
and it cannot break the bank.

107
00:04:30.860 --> 00:04:32.330
I'm gonna hit up some thrift stores.

108
00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.140
I'm even gonna do some online shopping.

109
00:04:34.140 --> 00:04:36.760
This is going to be the best makeover

110
00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.450
