111
00:04:38.450 --> 00:04:40.960
(upbeat music)

112
00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.460
Whenever you're doing a home renovation project

113
00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:46.360 line:15%
the most important thing is finding the budget

114
00:04:46.360 --> 00:04:48.550 line:15%
and definitely sticking to it.

115
00:04:48.550 --> 00:04:51.980 line:15%
Always try to shop for things that you absolutely love.

116
00:04:51.980 --> 00:04:53.550
Whenever I'm in a thrift shop,

117
00:04:53.550 --> 00:04:55.430 line:15%
I give one once around,

118
00:04:55.430 --> 00:04:56.800 line:15%
then I go back again.

119
00:04:56.800 --> 00:04:59.380 line:15%
And if I really love it, that's when I pick it up.

120
00:04:59.380 --> 00:05:02.290 line:15%
One of the nicest things about shopping in a thrift store

121
00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.610
is that you can find things

122
00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:05.130 line:15%
that are good for the environment,

123
00:05:05.130 --> 00:05:07.310 line:15%
but also good for your wallet as well.

124
00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:10.120 line:15%
So, for instance, take a look at this chair right here.

125
00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.310
This is a beautiful piece

126
00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.870
and you can oftentimes find really good bargains

127
00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:15.313
on things that are current.

128
00:05:16.420 --> 00:05:18.623
Hmm, this could work.

129
00:05:19.750 --> 00:05:22.960
It's the lampshade that's the problem.

130
00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:26.480 line:15%
If I find a simple, white lampshade,

131
00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:30.400 line:15%
this gives her that bling that she likes, it's acrylic.

132
00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.990 line:15%
This is the answer.

133
00:05:31.990 --> 00:05:33.960
I've got my big purchase here.

134
00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:37.050
If you could just let me know the final number on that.

135
00:05:37.050 --> 00:05:38.840
Of course.
Make it a good one.

136
00:05:38.840 --> 00:05:40.810
Drew likes a bargain.

137
00:05:40.810 --> 00:05:43.020
That is $25 today.

138
00:05:43.020 --> 00:05:46.053
You are speaking music to my ears.

139
00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:47.833
That's a win.

140
00:05:49.240 --> 00:05:51.040
So now that I'm back at the office,

141
00:05:51.040 --> 00:05:53.710
there is one other place where you can go

142
00:05:53.710 --> 00:05:56.040
and get a big bang for your buck,

143
00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.720
and that's right here from your own computer.

144
00:05:58.720 --> 00:06:01.140
When you're shopping, you need to find people

145
00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:05.040
who do not understand the true value of what they have.

146
00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:08.830
If I'm looking for a fancy, mid-century, modern sofa,

147
00:06:08.830 --> 00:06:11.390
I will never write that out.

148
00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:14.630 line:15%
You need to stick to people who have layman's terms,

149
00:06:14.630 --> 00:06:16.570 line:15%
