150
00:06:16.570 --> 00:06:19.700 line:15%
The person selling the couch doesn't know what they have

151
00:06:19.700 --> 00:06:23.050 line:15%
and you can typically get your price point much better.

152
00:06:23.050 --> 00:06:25.040
Whenever you're shopping for items,

153
00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:28.400
you wanna make sure that you actually go

154
00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.800 line:15%
